## When Starting a New Task

1. Read gentleborn/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md if not already in context
2. Understand which of the 7 agents this task relates to (or if it's infrastructure)
3. Check if HIPAA compliance is touched (it usually is)
4. Verify any external services involved have BAAs
5. Plan the change before making it
6. Generate code that matches existing patterns in the codebase
